Loops and Arrays Assignment

1. Write a program to create String array and print all the values in that array.

public class StringArray {

	public static void main(String[] args) {


		String[] languages= {"C++","html","java","python"};
		
		for(String lan:languages) {
			System.out.println("Languages:"+lan);
		}
		
	}

}

Output :
Languages:C++
Languages:html
Languages:java
Languages:python

