2. Write a sample program for while loop and do-while loop.

public class While_DoWhile {

	public static void main(String[] args) {

		int i=1;
		
		while(i<=5) {
			
			System.out.println(i);
			i++;
		}
	}

}
Output: 
1
2
3
4
5


------------------

public class While_DoWhile {

	public static void main(String[] args) {

		int i=1;
		
		do {
			
			System.out.println(i);
			i++;
			
		} while (i<=5);
	}

}
Output: 
1
2
3
4
5





